sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App as Mobile app
    participant Fn as log-workout function
    participant Engine as Gamification engine
    participant DB as Database
    User->>App: Fill in workout and tap "Save workout"
    App->>Fn: Send workout (type, date, minutes, exercises)
    Note over Fn: Check anti-abuse rules<br/>(date, length, daily cap)
    Fn->>DB: Save workout and exercises
    Fn->>Engine: Evaluate rewards for this workout
    Engine->>DB: Read streak, challenges, achievements
    Engine->>DB: Insert XP events (workout, streak bonus, challenge)
    Engine->>DB: Update streak and challenge progress
    Note over Engine: Check for new achievements<br/>and level up
    Engine-->>Fn: XP gained, new streak, level up yes or no
    Fn-->>App: Reward summary
    App-->>User: Show "Workout saved" screen
    opt Level went up
        App-->>User: Show "Level up" screen with unlocked reward
    end
